ps://imgur.com/a/W8WgLMK", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@meneathedog/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ae4647df/uploads/origins/a838a5e0-3a4e-46db-b388-008455708000?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61fabd6d0e87c7dd0db1ea07e4750a68", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ae4647df/uploads/origins/a838a5e0-3a4e-46db-b388-008455708000?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61fabd6d0e87c7dd0db1ea07e4750a68, https://si.imgix.net/ae4647df/uploads/origins/a838a5e0-3a4e-46db-b388-008455708000?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=befd7e8dce8b67d1f7ef5e059f398ffb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ae4647df/uploads/origins/a838a5e0-3a4e-46db-b388-008455708000?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9df3d4df632c8d9fef68cb8d9f518abe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n\n私の2人のOCのアートをお願いしたいのですが。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/dbXgCLM\nhttps://imgur.com/a/jttIpXH\n\n2人のキャラクターが水着かビキニを着ているのをお願いしたいです。\n\nメロディーは胸は控えめですが、太ももやお尻は健康的です。性格はおてんばです。\n\nDIAはクールなお姉さんという雰囲気です。二人とも自信に満ち溢れた表情、楽しそうな表情でお願いします。ポーズの詳細は先生のお好みにお任せします。\n\nご自由に描いてください。先生にとってかっこいいシーンであればうれしいです。\n\nご検討よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@meneathedog/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/955d7eea/uploads/origins/8c70a275-3984-4b0c-88c1-0c799a57b00f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75ff5b9d6f341a6890deaeb353cef4e5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/955d7eea/uploads/origins/8c70a275-3984-4b0c-88c1-0c799a57b00f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75ff5b9d6f341a6890deaeb353cef4e5, https://si.imgix.net/955d7eea/uploads/origins/8c70a275-3984-4b0c-88c1-0c799a57b00f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8b20b00edfea263bbdffdaa9da3c492 2x, https://si.imgix.net/955d7eea/uploads/origins/8c70a275-3984-4b0c-88c1-0c799a57b00f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed24fc0f0cdf13e435c8b9460d671399 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "I have changed the links to imgur. I hope that this works for you!\n\nHello. I love your art! You draw smug expressions so nicely, and this piece of Bernkastel from Umineko really caught my attention: https://skeb.jp/@meneathedog/works/21\n\nCan you draw VTuber Iekushi Chapipi ( https://twitter.com/IekushiChapipi )?\n\nChapipi is a computer virus and a bit of a brat, but also gets flustered and embarrassed easily! She can also sing very well. She's very talented and tries to provide a lot of variety! This includes being cute sometimes, cool other times, and seductive when she wants to be.\n\nCan you draw Chapipi wearing a facial expression similar to the reference below? Chapipi's outfit, pose, and any background can be up to you!\n\nChapipi may want to use your work for SNS or thumbnails, so please decline the request if that is not okay.\n\nThank you!\n\nCharacter References:\nhttps://imgur.com/a/9cVc4MD\n\nExpression Reference:\nhttps://imgur.com/a/7BwJ1H4\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/9cVc4MD", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@meneathedog/works/30", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b595923/uploads/origins/7f0f3fff-2c84-401f-9663-a2ecbd5019ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=550c1e8924831c21510db2710d96404b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b595923/uploads/origins/7f0f3fff-2c84-401f-9663-a2ecbd5019ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=550c1e8924831c21510db2710d96404b, https://si.imgix.net/2b595923/uploads/origins/7f0f3fff-2c84-401f-9663-a2ecbd5019ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f31ddae0847432cca2fb02ca7971e733 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b595923/uploads/origins/7f0f3fff-2c84-401f-9663-a2ecbd5019ed?bg=%23fff&auto=f